      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilsonville%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wilsonville Public Library, founded in 1982, circulated nearly half a million books in 2006‑2007.",
